# Two Thought Reflections: "the effects of multiple Thought Reflections are cumulative" (its ruling; CR 614.5, 616.1). Each
# replacement effect gets one opportunity at an event and at the events that replace it: the first Thought Reflection
# Bot1 applies to its turn 5 draw makes it two draws, and the other replaces each of those with two more, while neither
# applies a second time - so the one draw is four cards, no more (an effect applying to its own draws again would never
# stop) and no fewer. The first is cast on turn 1, the second on turn 3, whose draw step the first alone made two cards
# (an Island and Mox Emerald, which helps pay for the second).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Thought Reflection
Thought Reflection
Island
Mox Emerald
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

